## 🔥 **Runtime Verification Architecture:**

### **1. Verified Inference Engine**[1]

```zig
pub fn performVerifiedInference(self: *Self, input: []const f32, outputbuf: []f32) !void {
    // ✅ RUNTIME CHECKS minden inference-nél:

    // 1️⃣ Input commitment generálás
    const inputcommitment = try self.commitInput(input);

    // 2️⃣ Minden layer stepet rögzít proof-hoz
    try self.proofofcorrectness.recordStep(1, input, intermediate1, 
        obf.ProofOfCorrectness.OperationType.MatrixMultiply);

    // 3️⃣ Differential Privacy RUNTIME
    for (outputbuf) |val| {
        const noisy = self.differentialprivacy.addLaplaceNoise(val);
        val.* = @floatCast(noisy);
    }

    // 4️⃣ ZK Proof generálás RUNTIME-ban
    if (self.usezkproofs and self.zkprover != null) {
        inferenceproof.proveInferenceWithZK(input, outputbuf, weightss, weightst);
    }

    // 5️⃣ Proof verification + counter increment
    self.verificationcount += 1;
    if (try self.verifyProofOfCorrectness()) {
        self.successfulverifications += 1;
    }
}
```

